This is super-handy.  I don't know how I didn't find it:
>   https://man.netbsd.org/alpha/boot.8

And form it, I learned this:
"Just as with Sun systems, Alpha systems will use the
first serial port as a console if there is no keyboard
plugged into the keyboard port, even if console is set to
"graphics"."

Which is super hand to know about this old DEC equipment!

Thanks,
David


